{"text": "Nickel Basin Physiotherapy & Rehab\n1890 Regent Street, Unit 4, Sudbury ON P3E 3Z7 - tel 705-555-0164 - fax 705-555-0165\nHealth Professional's Progress Report (Program of Care - Shoulder / Low Back)\nWorker\tROBICHAUD, Gaétan\nDate of birth\t17/10/1979\nWSIB claim no.\t31884207\nOntario health card\t6839 204 517 KT\nDate of injury\t2026-02-11\nEmployer\tOnaping Ridge Mining Services Ltd.\nReport date\tApril 24, 2026\nClaims adjuster\tCorinne Assiniwe, 1-800-555-0126 x 4471\n\nInjury\nMr. Robichaud is a 46-year-old underground scoop-tram operator at the Levack site. On February 11 he was thrown against the cab frame when the machine struck a muck pile. Diagnoses per Form 8 from Dr. Lyle Kowbel (Lockerby Family Health Team): right rotator cuff strain and mechanical low back pain. MRI of March 19 showed a partial-thickness supraspinatus tear and a small disc bulge at L4-L5, no nerve root contact. He reports a previous back strain in 2019, claim 29470116, fully resolved.\nTreatment to date\nInitial assessment Feb. 23, 2026. 15 visits attended, 2 missed (March 30, April 9 - highway closed). Manual therapy, progressive cuff and scapular strengthening, lumbar stabilization, HEP reviewed each visit. He takes naproxen 500 mg twice daily and stopped cyclobenzaprine on his own because of drowsiness.\nFindings\nMeasure\tInitial\tNow\nPain, shoulder (NRS)\t8/10\t3/10\nDASH score\t62/100\t31/100\nFlexion, right\t95 deg\t150 deg\nAbduction, right\t80 deg\t140 deg\nCuff strength\t3/5\t4+/5\n\nLifting floor to waist: 15 kg occasional. Overhead work not yet tolerated. He says sleep is still broken and that he is \"fed up and not himself\"; I have suggested he raise this with Dr. Kowbel.\nReturn to work\nModified duties (surface, parts crib) started 07/04/2026 at 4 hrs/day, now 6. Supervisor Marty Toivonen (705 555 0118, mtoivonen@onapingridge.example) confirms accommodation is available to the end of May. Target: regular duties, underground, by June 15, 2026. Restrictions on the attached Functional Abilities Form: no lifting over 15 kg, no overhead reach on the right, no operating vibrating equipment more than 2 hrs/shift. Gaétan drives 50 minutes each way from Chelmsford; mileage claim sent separately.\nRecommendations\nExtend Program of Care by 1 block (8 visits over 4 weeks). Orthopaedic consult only if strength plateaus. Discharge planned mid-June.\nFees\nBlock 2 (visits 9-15)\tC$612.50\nProgress report\t$41.00\nTotal this invoice no. NB-26-01884\t$653.50\n\nPayee: Nickel Basin Physiotherapy & Rehab, WSIB provider ID 70044182, HST no. 81442 7093 RT0001. Direct deposit to the account on file ending 4417.\nPriyanka Vaidyanathan, Reg'd Physiotherapist, CPO reg. no. 18842\npvaidyanathan@nickelbasinphysio.example\nSigned P. Vaidyanathan, 24 Apr 2026", "kind": "Rich Text document", "detail": "422 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Gaétan Robichaud", "Corinne Assiniwe", "Lyle Kowbel", "Priyanka Vaidyanathan"], "companies": ["Nickel Basin Physiotherapy & Rehab", "Onaping Ridge Mining Services Ltd.", "Lockerby Family Health Team", "Health Professional's Progress Report", "Levack site", "Naproxen", "Cyclobenzaprine", "DASH score", "Cuff strength", "Nickel Basin", "Nickel Basin Physiotherapy", "Chelmsford"]}, "topics": {"places": ["Sudbury", "ON", "Chelmsford"], "health": ["shoulder", "Low Back Pain", "rotator cuff strain", "pulmonary contusion", "mechanical low back pain", "partial-thickness supraspinatus tear", "disc bulge", "naproxen", "cyclobenzaprine", "sleep broken", "strength plateaus"], "sensitive": [], "names": ["Gaétan", "Lyle", "Marty", "Priyanka"]}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "topicErrors": 0, "importMs": 0.8000000007450581, "modelMs": 0, "topicMs": 35339.199999999255, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "card_partial", "phone", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "street", "z